
## Important Notes

⚠️ **Skiplagging Risks:**
- Airlines may cancel your return flight if you skip a leg
- You cannot check bags (they'll go to the final destination)
- Frequent use may result in account penalties
- Only works for one-way or the last leg of a trip

## Default Target Routes

The tool includes smart defaults for common destinations:

| Destination | Target Routes (cities beyond) |
|-------------|------------------------------|
| PHX (Phoenix) | LAX, SAN, SFO, PDX, SEA |
| DEN (Denver) | LAX, SFO, SEA, PDX, SAN, LAS |
| DFW (Dallas) | LAX, SAN, PHX, LAS, SFO |
| ATL (Atlanta) | MIA, FLL, TPA, MCO, SJU |
| ORD (Chicago) | LAX, SFO, SEA, DEN, PHX |

